4,Central Melanau - mel (Austronesian) - PeopleGroups.org,https://peoplegroups.org/language/mel/,"Central Melanau (mel) is part of the Austronesian family and Austronesian, Malayo-Polynesian, North Borneo, Melanau-Kajang, Melanau class. Central Melanau speaking People Groups across the world: Fast Facts: Types.","Melanau, Central",Austronesian
